Z||000014||WKDFIRO||12-16-1999||01:49 PM||||Personally I always found most, (I have not found one yet but I know that it has to be out there...) are of a smaller diameter than stock. It might be a 1/2 difference but I don't like that feeling. I found my replacement steering wheel in a junkyard soon after I got my GT. It was behind another steering wheel and I got it for $50! ||||reg||10
